title No rung parameter, two rungs home on a drift, and a citation that could not survive its own file
prompt Autonomous loop -- Standfast on reds, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the Caravan lift arc
think Standfast pass first, run rather than recited: crux/REDS.md clear through %141, era suite GREEN at 12 of 12 before any constructive work.
think Council rota lap index: git log holds 3280 commits, 3280 mod 5 = 0, so row 0 -- Aether/Jupiter, why the work exists: follow our compass, the Lindy effect, the grain and the crossing.
think The prior lap named already_holds at 420 with forty-three free import bindings of capabilities. Re-priced it and read the harness import list to confirm capabilities and std both sit there.
think Read the body and found it reaches nothing through the rung at all -- only capabilities.DependentSlot, capabilities.max_caps_per_dependent, and std.mem.eql. So the lift takes no comptime rung parameter, the second row of this arc to need none.
think Forty-five rungs declare it and only forty-three wrote the identical body, so I read the other two rather than assuming a structural split.
think confer.rye and revoke.rye assert the ceiling inside the loop on every iteration where the forty-three assert it once as a precondition. Both refuse the same malformed slot; the precondition form refuses it before caps[0] is read.
think That is drift rather than meaning, unlike revoke_one's four which reached their counters at genuinely different depths. Named it in the doc block for a later lap rather than silently converting two asserts.
think Carry fell 65,999 to 65,579 -- exactly the predicted 420, the seventh exact hit.
think Then the choir went RED at caravan_ladder_copy_witness: my own GREEN line recited "line 52" with no assert holding it, and the same shape stood in two other places from earlier laps.
think Root is broader than the guard's message: a line number is a fact about a file that moves every time a line is added above it, and this arc adds forty lines to that file on a good lap. Swept all six to "at its own head".
obs The guard fired on the second lap that wrote the shape rather than the first, because the door_admits lap spelled its number in words. A meter that reads digits sees half of what it is looking for -- worth remembering before trusting a prose guard's silence.
obs already_holds needed no rung parameter, which makes the widening column's whole argument concrete: forty-three priced widenings, zero paid, and the answer was in the harness's import list rather than in any rung.
obs Two rungs staying home is now a reading with two distinct verdicts in this arc -- structural (revoke_one's four, rightly home) and drift (these two, home for now and named for a later lap). The column does not tell them apart; only reading the bodies does.
